      "title": "#6 残酷的真实"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3715001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "这是很久之前的过去——\n位于「爱猫社区」你最熟悉的家中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这个手办的身体，是怎么回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "表层的涂料斑驳不堪，她的身上发生了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "明明在笑着，却隐隐有一种悲伤的感觉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "帮她修补一下，应该能完好如初。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "3715007",
              "text": "用手轻轻托住它"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "3715006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "这里是……什么地方？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪！你在哪里？回答我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "眼前陌生的人类……是谁，|102|的手，好温柔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715010",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "身体好痛……好痛……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪！优纪！你能听到我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我已经赶到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪！优纪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715014",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "我是谁……为什么会在这里……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "3715016",
              "text": "帮助眼前的手办修复身体的瑕疵"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "3715015",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715016",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "蘸有颜色的涂料笔，在划过身体……\n这样的话……那些记忆、那些记忆……就会……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715017",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪（回忆）",
          "text": "身体上的蓝色的涂料……是、是我的记忆……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "似乎听到了一阵虚弱而微小的声音，是掌心的手办发出来的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪？是你吗？是你在说话吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715020",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪！看到终端的信息了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是什么人……在叫我的名字吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "掌心？好温暖的……掌心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "记忆……越来越模糊了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这样的话……「奇迹涂料」的地点，不就……不就要忘……记……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715025",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "对不起，对方未查看终端信息，请稍后再试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715026",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "请稍后再试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3715027",
          "sourceType": 13,
          "speaker": "M. The 3rd Sect.",
          "text": "请稍后再试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-187",
